{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TALENT IS YOUR ENEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror where you must solve puzzles in the dark atmosphere of the SFUMATO world. A world where reality and fiction are intertwined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness is your friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot fight unknown creatures, try to avoid or hide from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614200/extras/9e318ce65f32099f7643d5247a0de2b6.avif?t=1759896775\" width=1560 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paintings lie to you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the worlds inside paintings to break free and stop the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614200/extras/a5282d0af790646240d73ebc9e19ee03.avif?t=1759896775\" width=1560 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shadow sides of personalities in a dark atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a minimalist soundtrack and sound design that perfectly complements the horror atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art, where every pixel is placed with love.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614200?t=1759896775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614200?t=1759896775","capsule_image"